      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Received three quotes from SolarQuotes-recommended contractors and ultimately chose Sinwave Solar.The quoting process was smooth and professional. The team took the time to understand my needs and preferences, offering three well-considered options. They were responsive to my feedback, adjusting the final proposal without hesitation to ensure the system met my exact requirements. Throughout the process, their focus was on delivering a solution that suited me, with no pressure or complications.As a former electrical contractor, I paid close attention to the quality and safety of the installation. This was a key factor in my decision, as I wanted a system that was not only efficient but also installed to the highest standard. Sinwave Solar exceeded my expectations—their workmanship was excellent, they used high-quality materials, and they took great care of my property. They also kept me informed throughout the installation, consulting me on all key aspects for my approval.If you're looking for a high-quality solar installation tailored to your specific needs, I highly recommend Sinwave Solar. Their professionalism, attention to detail, and commitment to delivering a top-tier solution make them an excellent choice.",
